flowchart TD
    %% ------------------ Dev/Repo ------------------
    Dev[Git Commit / Pull Request] --> CI[CI Pipeline: Jenkins]

    %% ------------------ CI Pipeline ------------------
    CI -->|Full Tree Snapshot| Release[Immutable Release Directory]
    Release --> Storage[:contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}]

    %% ------------------ Storage Replication ------------------
    Storage -->|Native replication| StorageCross[FlashBlade Cross-Region]

    %% ------------------ Nodes Region A ------------------
    subgraph RegionA["Region A Nodes"]
        NodesA1[Node 1] 
        NodesA2[Node 2] 
        NodesA3[Node 3] 
        NodesA1 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchA1[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        NodesA2 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchA2[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        NodesA3 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchA3[Atomic Symlink Switch]
    end

    Storage --> NodesA1
    Storage --> NodesA2
    Storage --> NodesA3

    %% ------------------ Nodes Region B ------------------
    subgraph RegionB["Region B Nodes"]
        NodesB1[Node 1]
        NodesB2[Node 2]
        NodesB3[Node 3]
        NodesB1 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchB1[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        NodesB2 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchB2[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        NodesB3 -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchB3[Atomic Symlink Switch]
    end

    StorageCross --> NodesB1
    StorageCross --> NodesB2
    StorageCross --> NodesB3

    %% ------------------ Services ------------------
    SwitchA1 --> ServiceA1[Restart Service if Config Changed]
    SwitchA2 --> ServiceA2[Restart Service if Config Changed]
    SwitchA3 --> ServiceA3[Restart Service if Config Changed]
    SwitchB1 --> ServiceB1[Restart Service if Config Changed]
    SwitchB2 --> ServiceB2[Restart Service if Config Changed]
    SwitchB3 --> ServiceB3[Restart Service if Config Changed]
